<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Logistic · Cada regreso cuenta</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --navy: #102c40;
      --lime: #b6ed79;
      --muted: #62717c;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: #f5f7f4;
      color: var(--navy);
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
    }

    .wrap {
      width: min(1180px, 90%);
      margin: auto;
    }

    nav {
      height: 84px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .brand {
      font-size: 27px;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-decoration: none;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    .brand span {
      background: var(--navy);
      color: var(--lime);
      padding: 4px 9px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      margin-right: 9px;
    }

    nav .links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 28px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    nav .links a {
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .hero {
      background: var(--navy);
      color: white;
      padding: 62px 0 48px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--lime);
    }

    .hero-top {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 1fr;
      gap: 65px;
      align-items: end;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(40px, 5.2vw, 68px);
      line-height: 1.02;
      letter-spacing: -3px;
      margin: 18px 0 0;
    }

    h1 em {
      font-style: normal;
      color: var(--lime);
    }

    .intro {
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #c8d5de;
      margin: 0 0 24px;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--lime);
      color: var(--navy);
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 13px 20px;
      border-radius: 7px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .textlink {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: white;
      text-underline-offset: 5px;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 14px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .simulation {
      margin-top: 42px;
      border: 1px solid #486071;
      border-radius: 18px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #17364b;
    }

    .sim-head {
      padding: 21px 26px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #3d5667;
      gap: 15px;
    }

    .sim-head strong {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .badge {
      font-size: 12px;
      background: #314b5b;
      color: #e1e9ee;
      padding: 7px 11px;
      border-radius: 30px;
    }

    .sim-body {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 250px;
      min-height: 290px;
    }

    .journey {
      position: relative;
      padding: 28px 28px 20px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .route-label {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      color: #b9cbd8;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .route-label b {
      color: white;
    }

    .road {
      position: relative;
      margin-top: 76px;
      height: 83px;
      background: #25313c;
      border-top: 3px solid #83949c;
      border-bottom: 3px solid #83949c;
    }

    .road::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 38px;
      width: 100%;
      height: 3px;
      background: repeating-linear-gradient(
        90deg,
        #d2d7d9 0 23px,
        transparent 23px 48px
      );
      opacity: .6;
    }

    .truck {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 40px;
      left: 0;
      width: 96px;
      height: 62px;
      z-index: 2;
      color: #f1b458;
      animation: drive 14s linear infinite;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 5px 4px #0006);
    }

    .truck svg {
      width: 96px;
      height: 62px;
      fill: #203344;
      stroke: currentColor;
      stroke-width: 1.6;
    }

    .marker {
      position: absolute;
      left: 65%;
      top: -48px;
      border-left: 1px dashed #b6ed79;
      height: 132px;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .marker span {
      position: absolute;
      top: -26px;
      left: -49px;
      background: var(--lime);
      color: var(--navy);
      padding: 5px 9px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: bold;
      border-radius: 5px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .stations {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      position: relative;
      margin-top: 14px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .stations .middle {
      position: absolute;
      left: 65%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
    }

    .legend {
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 26px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #c9d6de;
    }

    .legend i {
      display: inline-block;
      width: 18px;
      height: 3px;
      background: #f1b458;
      margin-right: 7px;
      vertical-align: middle;
    }

    .legend .green {
      background: var(--lime);
    }

    .metrics {
      background: #0e293b;
      padding: 26px;
      border-left: 1px solid #3d5667;
    }

    .metrics small {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #bacbd6;
    }

    .metric {
      font-size: 46px;
      letter-spacing: -2px;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 8px 0;
      color: #f1b458;
    }

    .metric span {
      font-size: 17px;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .metrics p {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #cad6dd;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .status {
      color: var(--lime) !important;
      border-top: 1px solid #385162;
      padding-top: 16px;
    }

    .phase-copy {
      display: grid;
      min-height: 22px;
      margin: 14px 0 0;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #d6e3eb;
    }

    .phase-copy .empty,
    .phase-copy .loaded {
      grid-area: 1 / 1;
    }

    .phase-copy .empty {
      animation: empty 14s linear infinite;
    }

    .phase-copy .loaded {
      animation: loaded 14s linear infinite;
      color: var(--lime);
    }

    .sim-foot {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 15px;
      padding: 13px 26px;
      background: #203f54;
      color: #c4d4de;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .pause-label {
      cursor: pointer;
      color: white;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .pause-label input {
      accent-color: var(--lime);
      vertical-align: middle;
    }

    .simulation:has(#pause:checked) * {
      animation-play-state: paused !important;
    }

    .below {
      padding: 54px 0;
    }

    .section-head {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: end;
      gap: 30px;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 32px;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .section-head p {
      max-width: 410px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .steps {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 26px;
      margin-top: 27px;
    }

    .step {
      border-top: 1px solid #ced8d2;
      padding-top: 21px;
    }

    .step small {
      color: #548038;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .step h3 {
      font-size: 17px;
      margin: 12px 0;
    }

    .step p {
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .service-card {
      padding: 24px;
      border: 1px solid #dce4df;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .service-card p {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .note {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-top: 25px;
    }

    .registration {
      padding: 54px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid #dce4df;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .registration h2 {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .registration .lead {
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 760px;
    }

    .reg-notice {
      padding: 16px 20px;
      background: #fff5db;
      border: 1px solid #e3d3a9;
      border-radius: 10px;
      color: #665221;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .reg-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .reg-profiles {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .reg-profile {
      display: block;
      padding: 23px;
      border: 2px solid #dce4df;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: white;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .reg-profile:has(input:checked) {
      border-color: #548728;
      background: #edf5e7;
    }

    .reg-profile strong,
    .reg-profile span {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }

    .reg-profile span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .registration fieldset {
      min-width: 0;
      margin: 26px 0;
      padding: 24px;
      border: 1px solid #dce4df;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: white;
    }

    .registration legend {
      padding: 0 8px;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .registration .reg-selection {
      padding: 0;
      border: 0;
      background: transparent;
    }

    .registration .reg-selection legend {
      padding: 0;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .reg-field {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 7px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .reg-field input,
    .reg-field select,
    .reg-field textarea {
      width: 100%;
      min-width: 0;
      border: 1px solid #aebeb7;
      border-radius: 7px;
      padding: 11px;
      font: inherit;
      background: white;
      color: var(--navy);
    }

    .reg-field textarea {
      min-height: 95px;
      resize: vertical;
    }

    .reg-field small {
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .registration input[type="radio"],
    .registration input[type="checkbox"] {
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
      accent-color: #426d28;
    }

    .reg-help {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .reg-check {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 10px;
      margin: 16px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .reg-check input {
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .reg-verification {
      padding: 20px;
      background: #f5f7f4;
      border: 1px solid #dce4df;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    .reg-verification h3 {
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .reg-status {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 5px 12px;
      background: #fff0cd;
      color: #755713;
      border-radius: 25px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .registration button {
      font: inherit;
      border: 0;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .registration button:disabled {
      opacity: .6;
      cursor: not-allowed;
    }

    .reg-form,
    .reg-company,
    .reg-cargo,
    .reg-carrier,
    .reg-independent {
      display: none;
    }

    form:has(.reg-selector:checked) .reg-form {
      display: block;
    }

    form:has(#generador:checked) .reg-company,
    form:has(#transportista:checked) .reg-company,
    form:has(#generador:checked) .reg-cargo,
    form:has(#transportista:checked) .reg-carrier,
    form:has(#independiente:checked) .reg-carrier,
    form:has(#independiente:checked) .reg-independent {
      display: block;
    }

    .registration details,
    .legal details {
      border: 1px solid #dce4df;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: white;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .registration summary,
    .legal summary {
      padding: 18px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .reg-detail {
      padding: 0 20px 22px;
    }

    .reg-review {
      display: none;
    }

    .reg-review:target {
      display: block;
    }

    .reg-review article {
      max-width: 780px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 30px;
      border: 1px solid #dce4df;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: white;
    }

    .reg-review li {
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .legal {
      padding-bottom: 40px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .legal p {
      padding: 0 20px 20px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid #dce4df;
      padding: 23px 0;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    a:focus-visible,
    input:focus-visible,
    select:focus-visible,
    textarea:focus-visible,
    button:focus-visible,
    summary:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid #80ad54;
      outline-offset: 5px;
    }

    #ejemplo,
    #como-funciona,
    #registro,
    #revision {
      scroll-margin-top: 24px;
    }

    @keyframes drive {
      0% {
        left: 0;
        color: #f1b458;
      }

      57%, 65% {
        left: calc(65% - 48px);
        color: #f1b458;
      }

      66% {
        color: #b6ed79;
      }

      94%, 100% {
        left: calc(100% - 96px);
        color: #b6ed79;
      }
    }

    @keyframes empty {
      0%, 65% {
        opacity: 1;
      }

      66%, 100% {
        opacity: 0;
      }
    }

    @keyframes loaded {
      0%, 65% {
        opacity: 0;
      }

      66%, 100% {
        opacity: 1;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 800px) {
      nav {
        height: auto;
        min-height: 84px;
        gap: 18px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        padding: 18px 0;
      }

      nav .links {
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 12px;
        font-size: 12px;
      }

      .hero-top {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 25px;
      }

      .sim-body {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .metrics {
        border-left: 0;
        border-top: 1px solid #3d5667;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 0 20px;
      }

      .metrics .metric {
        grid-row: 2;
      }

      .metrics p {
        margin: 5px 0;
      }

      .metrics .status {
        border: 0;
        grid-column: 2;
        grid-row: 2;
      }

      .section-head {
        display: block;
      }

      .steps,
      .reg-profiles {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .hero {
        padding-top: 35px;
      }

      .sim-foot {
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      .route-label {
        font-size: 12px;
      }

      .journey {
        padding-inline: 18px;
      }

      h1 {
        letter-spacing: -2px;
      }

      .sim-head {
        padding: 18px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      .badge {
        font-size: 11px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .reg-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .registration fieldset {
        padding: 18px;
      }

      .legend {
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      .registration h2 {
        font-size: 28px;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      html {
        scroll-behavior: auto;
      }

      .truck {
        animation: none;
        left: calc(65% - 48px);
      }

      .phase-copy .empty,
      .phase-copy .loaded {
        animation: none;
      }

      .phase-copy .loaded {
        display: none;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header class="wrap">
    <nav aria-label="Principal">
      <a class="brand" href="#inicio">
        <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>Logistic
      </a>

      <div class="links">
        <a href="#inicio">Inicio</a>
        <a href="#ejemplo">Cómo funciona</a>
        <a href="#registro">Registro</a>
        <a href="#contacto">Contacto</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="inicio">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="hero-top">
          <div>
            <div class="eyebrow">Logística inteligente de retorno</div>
            <h1>Que el regreso<br><em>también cuente.</em></h1>
          </div>

          <div>
            <p class="intro">
              Tu camión entregó en Monterrey. Ahora debe volver a
              Ciudad de México. Logistic conecta ese regreso con
              una nueva carga en el camino.
            </p>

            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a class="button" href="#registro">Elegir mi perfil ↗</a>
              <a class="textlink" href="#ejemplo">Cómo funciona ↗</a>
              <a class="textlink" href="#ejemplo">Ejemplo ilustrativo ↓</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="simulation" id="ejemplo">
          <div class="sim-head">
            <strong>El regreso de tu camión</strong>
            <span class="badge">
              Simulación ilustrativa · no es rastreo en vivo
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="sim-body">
            <div class="journey">
              <div class="route-label">
                <span>
                  IDA COMPLETADA<br>
                  <b>Ciudad de México → Monterrey</b>
                </span>

                <span>
                  AHORA: REGRESO A BASE<br>
                  <b>Monterrey → Ciudad de México</b>
                </span>
              </div>

              <div
                class="road"
                role="img"
                aria-label="El camión viaja vacío de Monterrey a Querétaro, recoge carga y continúa cargado a Ciudad de México."
              >
                <div class="marker">
                  <span>Recoge carga</span>
                </div>

                <div class="truck" aria-hidden="true">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 32 21">
                    <path d="M1 3h19v12H1zM20 8h6l5 5v2H20z"/>
                    <path d="M23 9h3l3 3h-6z" fill="#a5d9ed"/>
                    <circle cx="7" cy="16" r="3" fill="#101b24"/>
                    <circle cx="24" cy="16" r="3" fill="#101b24"/>
                    <circle cx="7" cy="16" r="1" fill="#ddd"/>
                    <circle cx="24" cy="16" r="1" fill="#ddd"/>
                  </svg>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="stations">
                <span>Monterrey</span>
                <span class="middle">Querétaro</span>
                <span>CDMX</span>
              </div>

              <div class="phase-copy">
                <span class="empty">
                  01 · Buscando aprovechar el regreso: tramo sin carga.
                </span>
                <span class="loaded">
                  02 · Carga recogida: regreso a base con mercancía.
                </span>
              </div>

              <div class="legend">
                <span><i aria-hidden="true"></i>Tramo vacío</span>
                <span>
                  <i class="green" aria-hidden="true"></i>Tramo con nueva carga
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <aside class="metrics">
              <small>KILÓMETROS VACÍOS DEL RETORNO</small>

              <div class="metric">
                700 <span>km</span>
              </div>

              <p>
                De 900 km de regreso,<br>
                200 km se recorren con carga.
              </p>

              <p class="status">
                ↗ 200 km vacíos evitados<br>
                <small>Querétaro → Ciudad de México</small>
              </p>
            </aside>
          </div>

          <div class="sim-foot">
            <span>
              Distancias ficticias para explicar la idea.
              El recorrido real puede variar.
            </span>

            <label class="pause-label">
              <input id="pause" type="checkbox">
              Pausar animación
            </label>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="below wrap" id="como-funciona">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>
          El mismo destino.<br>
          Un regreso mejor aprovechado.
        </h2>

        <p>
          Logistic sugiere la oportunidad. El transportista y la empresa
          acuerdan el precio y el contrato antes de confirmar.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="steps">
        <article class="step">
          <small>01 / REGISTRA TU RUTA</small>
          <h3>Entregas en Monterrey</h3>
          <p>
            Tu unidad salió de Ciudad de México con mercancía.
            Después de entregarla, debe regresar a su base.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="step">
          <small>02 / ENCUENTRA UNA COINCIDENCIA</small>
          <h3>Hay una carga en Querétaro</h3>
          <p>
            Logistic sugiere un pedido compatible con tu unidad
            y tu regreso. Acuerdas las condiciones con quien
            publica la carga.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="step">
          <small>03 / APROVECHA EL RETORNO</small>
          <h3>Vuelves a CDMX con carga</h3>
          <p>
            El tramo hasta Querétaro sigue vacío. Desde la recolección,
            transportas mercancía hacia el destino al que ya debías regresar.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <p class="note">
        Las distancias son ilustrativas, no resultados calculados ni garantizados.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="below wrap" id="servicios">
      <h2>Soluciones para cada parte del viaje</h2>

      <div class="steps">
        <article class="service-card">
          <small>Publicación de cargas</small>
          <h3>Origen, destino y necesidades</h3>
          <p>
